  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://bisecthosting.com/exline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/73838725-ba9a-49e1-83b8-c87b658405cb.webp\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">您有興趣支持我和我的模組開發嗎？如果是，我建議您試試 BisectHosting。作為新客戶，使用優惠碼：EXLINE，即可在首次訂購遊戲伺服器時享有 25% 折扣。憑藉 24/7 支援與快速回應，您將獲得卓越的服務體驗。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/976/banner_hammers.png\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/9UVGJGyqbv\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/993245467162972220?color=blue&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=plastic&amp;logo=discord\" width=\"191\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/members/exlinegames/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Curseforge-Projects-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=curseforge\" width=\"226\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fexline\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Modrinth-Profle-blue?style=plastic&amp;logo=modrinth\" width=\"185\" height=\"28\"></a></span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\"><strong>戰錘<br></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組新增了一種工具/武器：戰錘。<br></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">比劍更強，但揮舞速度較慢。掌握好時機，精準打擊，粉碎敵人。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">戰錘也可當作鎬使用，因此您能用它來挖掘。</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:24px\">下載</span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"