=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/959/iron_warhammer.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/960/gold_warhammer.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/961/diamond_warhammer.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/412/962/netherite_warhammer.png\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>要在生存模式中製作黑曜石戰錘，您需要黑曜石裝備。</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/obsidian-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/395/14/obsidian_equipment.png\"></a></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>如果您想要更多裝備，請看看這些！每個模組都會新增一把可合成的戰錘。（點擊展開）<br></strong></span></p><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/amethyst-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/394/948/banner_amethyst.png\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/bone-equipment\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><img src=\"https://medi